Package: flexPaths
Type: Package
Title: Causal Path-Specific Effect Estimation in Flexible Settings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xiaxian", "Ou", email = "xiaxian.ou@emory.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2905-8287")),
    person("Xinwei", "He", role = "aut"),
    person("Razieh", "Nabi", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Estimates identifiable path-specific means and effects in
    longitudinal studies with multiple causally ordered mediators and either
    a single binary treatment or repeated binary treatments. The package
    provides inverse probability weighting, plug-in g-computation, and
    influence-function-based estimators, with flexible modeling options for
    treatment assignment mechanisms and outcome regressions. Methods for
    longitudinal settings are described in Ou, He, and Nabi (2026)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2610.34349>.
